# Raw, transient per-run output from pytest-playwright's own
# --output=artifacts/test-results (bundles screenshot+trace per failing
# test). Meaningful evidence worth keeping is copied out, by hand, into
# artifacts/screenshots/ and artifacts/traces/, which ARE committed —
# see docs/SESSION_05_EXECUTION_DEBUGGING_AND_ARTIFACTS.md.
